      "artist": "Gfgbeach",
      "credit": "Own work",
      "source": "The Burning Blade Tavern Epic Universe",
      "description": "The Burning Blade Tavern is in the Dark Universe world of Epic Universe. A fire show that happens multiple times per hour, weather permitting. The show mimics a scene in the 1931 Frankenstein movie, where a mob sets fire to a windmill containing the monster.\nIn the show the blades turn at a slow pace, and then begin to turn faster. Fire erupts from the center and spreads. The blades are on fire for about half a minute, and then quickly stop. The blades stop turning for a moment, and then resume slow pace. The show starts with a bell ringing in a nearby tower. The show happens day and night.",
